WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.649
junko I am a chronic excuse maker how do
I stop making excuses and get things

00:00:07.649 --> 00:00:09.859
done

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:19.260
the chronic excuse maker
have you stopped making excuses this is

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:23.880
actually pretty simple and I said it the
other day and you have to realize you

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:34.200
have to know you have to accept that all
your excuses are lies their lies all of

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:42.030
them think about the things that you
tell yourself the lies you used to

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:48.379
rationalize taking the easy road taking
the easy road and leaving discipline

00:00:48.379 --> 00:01:03.170
behind think about them you don't have
time that's a lie you don't have support

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:13.920
that's a lie you don't have the
equipment or the gear lies you don't you

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:20.610
don't know the best way who cares that's
a lie or you're too old or you're too

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:29.329
young of course you're too old or too
young lie and there's you're too busy

00:01:29.329 --> 00:01:38.400
sure you are
that's why and you're too tired or

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:46.979
you're too sore or you're just plain not
feeling it lies lies lies and the list

00:01:46.979 --> 00:01:59.800
goes on and on and on and it doesn't
stop if you don't make it stop so

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:13.870
recognize recognize the excuses are not
valid they are they're trumped up

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:21.050
they're conjured up they're fabricated
their lies and how do you stop the lies

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:29.980
you stop the lies with the truth the
truth the truth will set you free the

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:38.120
truth will stand and the truth will
deliver you from procrastination and

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:49.250
laziness and the downward spiral that
comes with a lack of discipline so don't

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:54.560
believe the lies believe the truth and
the truth is you have time you have the

00:02:54.560 --> 00:03:00.320
skill you have the knowledge and the
support and the willpower and the

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:17.180
discipline to get it done so cast out
the lies burn them down and listen to

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:24.489
the truth then live the truth and go out
and get it done

